                      (    forth6809.asm):06415         
                      (    forth6809.asm):06416                     ; Interpreting: copy the string to PAD. Original comment: shadow
                      (    forth6809.asm):06417                     ; SQUOTEW.2.
F495                  (    forth6809.asm):06418         SQINTERP:
