                      (    forth6809.asm):07635         ; deliberately absent because the Search-Order word set is not
                      (    forth6809.asm):07636         ; implemented. FLOORED is false because /, MOD and /MOD use symmetric
                      (    forth6809.asm):07637         ; division.
